title: 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
As I enter the club room, I see NaHyun practically lounging in her chair.
She has scrolled through her phone.
{name()}: Hey, NaHyun. Are you on a break?
NaHyun: (Looking up from her phone) Yeah.
NaHyun: I was just trying to figure out what to have for lunch.
{name()}: Are you going to order delivery?
<<choice 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_긍1_영문 "I'm hungry too." 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_부1_영문 "I'm still okay for now.">>
NaHyun: Yeah. Want to eat together?
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_긍1_영문
---
{name()}: Sure, let's eat together.
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +10>>
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: And why should I?
{name()}: ...
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: (Laughing) I'm just kidding. What do you want to eat?
<<if get("slv") < 3>>
    <<jump 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_의존성_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_일반_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_의존성_영문
---
<<show hyun_smile>>
{name()}: Whatever you're in the mood for.
NaHyun: How about Chinese food, then?
NaHyun: I actually know a really good place...
{name()}: Where is it? Tell me more.
(I spent some time chatting with NaHyun while we had lunch.)
(I feel like we've gotten a bit closer.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_일반_영문
---
<<show hyun_smile>>
{name()}: I'm actually craving Chinese food.
NaHyun: Shall we go with that then?
NaHyun: I actually know a really good place...
{name()}: Where is it? Tell me more.
(I spent some time chatting with NaHyun while we had lunch.)
(I feel like we've gotten a bit closer.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_동아리방_양나현_부1_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
{name()}: I'm not that hungry yet, so I'll probably eat a bit later.
NaHyun: Oh, really? Suit yourself, then.
<<show hyun_neg>>
<<play 양나현_흠>>
(NaHyun turns her attention back to her phone.)
<<end>>
===